WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.768
The Resources tab holds your prayer list, your church's sermons, and your sermon notes.

00:00:05.768 --> 00:00:07.262
Let's start with prayer.

00:00:08.065 --> 00:00:10.431
Write down what's on your heart today.

00:00:10.431 --> 00:00:13.420
Type it, or tap the microphone and simply speak.

00:00:13.420 --> 00:00:17.281
Press enter to start a new line, and tap Add when you're done.

00:00:18.083 --> 00:00:26.007
For the people you pray for every week, tick the weekly box before you tap Add, or tap the circle arrow beside any prayer.

00:00:26.007 --> 00:00:29.774
Choose the days, and those prayers come back on their own.

00:00:30.576 --> 00:00:36.251
Add an encouraging verse by typing its reference, or let the app suggest one for you.

00:00:37.052 --> 00:00:41.698
When God answers a prayer, tap Add answered prayer and write what He did.

00:00:41.698 --> 00:00:48.572
It's kept with your answered prayers, a record of His faithfulness, and it comes back on that day each week.
